      <description>In early March, the Department of Agriculture held the ‘Transforming Farming: Sustainable Regenerative Agriculture’ conference at Witpoort farm in Klerksdorp, where experts highlighted the importance of soil health and shared practical insights to help emerging farmers invest in regenerative practices. Farmer’s Weekly attended the event.</description>
